{"ep": "16", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:03.33", "end": "0:00:06.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么东西怪怪的  我不知为啥有这种感觉"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:08.31", "end": "0:00:13.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电视中正在播放的  是跟我一点关系都没有的同县选手的比赛"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:13.39", "end": "0:00:16.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥我正支持着正处于落后的一方"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:17.04", "end": "0:00:21.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后又不知为啥觉得差不多春日要搞点事出来了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:24.88", "end": "0:00:26.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  电话"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:26.82", "end": "0:00:28.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用你说我也知道"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:30.82", "end": "0:00:31.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你今天很闲吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:32.14", "end": "0:00:35.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两点整全员在车站前集合  老老实实地过来哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:39.03", "end": "0:00:41.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我连一句话都没说上"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:43.99", "end": "0:00:44.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:44.82", "end": "0:00:46.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "忘跟你说带东西来了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:46.87", "end": "0:00:49.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一套泳装  还有足够的钱"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:49.71", "end": "0:00:52.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后一定要骑自行车来  Over～"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 13, "start": "0:00:53.28", "end": "0:00:54.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啥啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 14, "start": "0:00:55.19", "end": "0:00:59.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我好像又知道春日打算要说啥"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 15, "start": "0:01:00.09", "end": "0:01:00.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不对"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 16, "start": "0:01:01.33", "end": "0:01:05.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说  是感觉之前好像出现过完全相同的事情"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 17, "start": "0:01:05.80", "end": "0:01:07.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是所谓的「既视感」么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 18, "start": "0:01:09.14", "end": "0:01:11.21", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "击中了  飞得很远很远"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 19, "start": "0:01:11.27", "end": "0:01:13.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天就这样缴枪了啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 20, "start": "0:02:47.39", "end": "0:02:48.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太慢了  阿虚！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 21, "start": "0:02:48.85", "end": "0:02:50.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多拿点干劲出来！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 22, "start": "0:02:50.63", "end": "0:02:51.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 23, "start": "0:02:52.45", "end": "0:02:53.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让你们久等真抱歉"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 24, "start": "0:02:54.36", "end": "0:02:56.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也才刚到"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 25, "start": "0:02:56.89", "end": "0:02:59.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  全都到齐了  出发吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 26, "start": "0:03:00.66", "end": "0:03:01.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去哪里？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:01.53", "end": "0:03:03.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是去市民游泳池啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:04.00", "end": "0:03:06.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了  从这准备的架势来看也是吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:06.54", "end": "0:03:10.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天要有夏天的样子  不能不做有夏天特色的事情"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:10.76", "end": "0:03:13.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "失去的时间可是一去不返的啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:14.46", "end": "0:03:15.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以现在就要行动"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:16.01", "end": "0:03:18.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这个只有一次的高一的暑假里"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:19.57", "end": "0:03:21.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺便我们是骑自行车去泳池"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:22.41", "end": "0:03:23.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们也骑来了么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:24.49", "end": "0:03:28.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  自行车只有你和我的两辆"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:28.32", "end": "0:03:28.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "诶？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:31.18", "end": "0:03:34.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听好了  阿虚  可不能输给古泉哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:35.43", "end": "0:03:37.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  立即出发"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 39, "start": "0:03:37.81", "end": "0:03:38.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "超能力禁止！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 40, "start": "0:03:39.96", "end": "0:03:42.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们两个赶紧停好车"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 41, "start": "0:03:43.39", "end": "0:03:46.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  接下来是要玩啊  你怎么就筋疲力尽了？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 42, "start": "0:03:46.96", "end": "0:03:48.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是谁的错啊  谁的啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 43, "start": "0:03:48.86", "end": "0:03:52.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这消毒液的气味  真给人一种实在的感觉啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 44, "start": "0:03:57.02", "end": "0:04:00.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "赶紧过来  水温温的很舒服哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:01.07", "end": "0:04:03.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙就看不见那些禁止跳水的文字说明么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:04.16", "end": "0:04:05.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "挺欢乐的嘛"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:06.09", "end": "0:04:11.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不觉得凉宫同学也学会了有常识性的娱乐方法了么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:12.52", "end": "0:04:18.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笑得那么开心的凉宫同学  是不会做什么震动这个世界的事情的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:18.93", "end": "0:04:20.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果真是那样就好了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:22.22", "end": "0:04:22.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:23.27", "end": "0:04:24.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  没什么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:28.27", "end": "0:04:29.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概是我的错觉吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:30.82", "end": "0:04:32.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也准备一下吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:53.25", "end": "0:04:54.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好苦  再来一杯！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 55, "start": "0:05:03.53", "end": "0:05:06.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "觉得这种景象以前也见到过"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 56, "start": "0:05:06.56", "end": "0:05:09.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥觉得长门好像有些无聊…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:10.38", "end": "0:05:10.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:12.69", "end": "0:05:16.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  然后春日说了这种话"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:16.90", "end": "0:05:18.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这两个就是我的团员"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:19.42", "end": "0:05:22.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说什么他们都会听的  所以随便吩咐吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:22.91", "end": "0:05:24.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  要玩了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:24.41", "end": "0:05:25.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来玩水中躲避球吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:27.55", "end": "0:05:28.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:29.61", "end": "0:05:31.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  这种事也常有"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:31.28", "end": "0:05:32.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既视感什么的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:35.57", "end": "0:05:39.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我试着考虑了下今后的活动计划  如何呢？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:39.97", "end": "0:05:40.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是啥"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:41.22", "end": "0:05:44.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "剩余不多的暑假该如何度过的预定表啦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:45.24", "end": "0:05:49.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我突然发现  暑假只剩下两个星期了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:50.14", "end": "0:05:52.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我都愕然了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 71, "start": "0:05:52.51", "end": "0:05:55.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明明还剩下很多事情想要去做"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 72, "start": "0:05:55.20", "end": "0:05:57.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但只是剩这么一点点时间"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 73, "start": "0:05:58.22", "end": "0:05:59.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后要赶快地去玩啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:00.50", "end": "0:06:02.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要在不到两周内搞完这个么…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:03.26", "end": "0:06:05.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠有什么想要做的事情么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:06.33", "end": "0:06:09.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…我想捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:10.00", "end": "0:06:12.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "OK  捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:13.48", "end": "0:06:14.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好意思  我看下"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:20.15", "end": "0:06:20.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:21.18", "end": "0:06:22.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天开始实行"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:23.05", "end": "0:06:25.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这附近什么地方有盂兰盆会么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:25.78", "end": "0:06:27.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有烟花汇演也可以"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:27.70", "end": "0:06:29.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我去查一下吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:29.55", "end": "0:06:30.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "回头再联系你"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:31.07", "end": "0:06:32.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别忘了捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:33.06", "end": "0:06:35.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可是实玖瑠的强烈要求哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:35.77", "end": "0:06:36.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "了解了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:37.84", "end": "0:06:39.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  今天就此解散"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 89, "start": "0:06:40.44", "end": "0:06:41.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我也回去了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 90, "start": "0:06:41.79", "end": "0:06:42.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 91, "start": "0:06:54.90", "end": "0:06:55.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 92, "start": "0:06:56.91", "end": "0:06:59.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不…我什么事也没有"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 93, "start": "0:06:59.99", "end": "0:07:02.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最近如何  精神好么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:03.12", "end": "0:07:03.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:04.44", "end": "0:07:05.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那太好了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:13.07", "end": "0:07:16.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  为什么我会去搭腔呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:26.22", "end": "0:07:30.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "盂兰盆会啊  真亏得能聚集起这么多人啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:30.65", "end": "0:07:31.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:33.82", "end": "0:07:34.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个楼塔"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:35.45", "end": "0:07:36.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个摊子"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:37.25", "end": "0:07:40.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明明应该是很久没来了  却觉得最近就来过"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:41.04", "end": "0:07:41.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:42.12", "end": "0:07:44.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那边有你想要玩的捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:44.99", "end": "0:07:46.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去捞个痛快吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:46.62", "end": "0:07:47.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:47.98", "end": "0:07:51.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也去玩吧  来一决高下如何"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:51.24", "end": "0:07:52.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 108, "start": "0:07:52.47", "end": "0:07:53.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比起这个来  长门"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 109, "start": "0:07:53.53", "end": "0:07:54.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要吃点什么吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 110, "start": "0:07:59.52", "end": "0:08:01.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你对那种东西有兴趣么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:01.61", "end": "0:08:02.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪个？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:02.28", "end": "0:08:02.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:03.65", "end": "0:08:04.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:04.27", "end": "0:08:05.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的  800日元"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:07.39", "end": "0:08:10.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥有种受她照顾的感觉"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:10.61", "end": "0:08:12.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种东西由我来买就好了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:13.83", "end": "0:08:17.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "十三条  呀～大丰收大丰收～"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:17.60", "end": "0:08:20.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我不需要那么多  就只要了一条"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:21.31", "end": "0:08:22.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有给实玖瑠的那份"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:24.93", "end": "0:08:26.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只吃一个的话没关系哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:27.40", "end": "0:08:28.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:29.73", "end": "0:08:32.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦  有希  你那面具哪里弄来的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:32.89", "end": "0:08:33.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "买的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:33.86", "end": "0:08:35.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  是么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:49.89", "end": "0:08:51.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在是夏天  在暑假中"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:52.50", "end": "0:08:54.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以  虽然极力想要忘记"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 127, "start": "0:08:55.28", "end": "0:08:57.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但有件事情却让我很在意"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 128, "start": "0:08:58.37", "end": "0:09:01.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日啊  虽说玩也没问题  你暑假作业做完了么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 129, "start": "0:09:02.59", "end": "0:09:07.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说什么嘛  那样的作业有三天不就全部做完了吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:07.31", "end": "0:09:07.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "三天！？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:08.73", "end": "0:09:14.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种麻烦事就得事先赶紧收拾掉再玩到爽"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:15.16", "end": "0:09:17.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么这种家伙脑子这么好"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:17.94", "end": "0:09:21.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "上天对于人的参数调整还真是随便啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:22.33", "end": "0:09:24.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  明天去捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:25.01", "end": "0:09:29.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捉到的虫子最多的那个人  怎么好呢…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:29.35", "end": "0:09:31.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把团长的权力让给他一天！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:32.03", "end": "0:09:32.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "才不要呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:32.92", "end": "0:09:36.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很有趣呢  只要是虫子的话什么都可以么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:36.81", "end": "0:09:39.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯…只能抓蝉"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:39.76", "end": "0:09:43.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  这就是SOS团内部的捉蝉大战！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 141, "start": "0:09:45.84", "end": "0:09:49.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  是个让人有种「连这也是啊」的感觉的大晴天"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 142, "start": "0:09:49.91", "end": "0:09:53.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团内部的捉蝉大战就在这大晴天下进行"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 143, "start": "0:09:55.01", "end": "0:09:56.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可不是蝉啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 144, "start": "0:09:56.44", "end": "0:09:58.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…啊  这是超巨型金龟子！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 145, "start": "0:09:58.74", "end": "0:10:03.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说大家都在努力奋斗  可应该说不出所料还是说啥呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 146, "start": "0:10:03.75", "end": "0:10:05.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "获胜者是春日"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 147, "start": "0:10:06.35", "end": "0:10:09.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说到底  还是要有放生的精神"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 148, "start": "0:10:10.69", "end": "0:10:14.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天放它们一条生路  以后说不定会来报恩呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:15.11", "end": "0:10:18.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "蝉来了到底能为我们做些啥啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:20.72", "end": "0:10:22.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  快回山里去吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:27.88", "end": "0:10:31.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总觉得  有点打开了盒子的潘多拉的感觉呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:32.65", "end": "0:10:35.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "欢…欢迎光临"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:35.42", "end": "0:10:39.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  我们在还没搞清状况的状态下就被召集了起来"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:39.58", "end": "0:10:42.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在一无所知的情况下被套上了青蛙的罩衣"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:42.70", "end": "0:10:46.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开始在超市的门口发气球的兼职"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:51.42", "end": "0:10:54.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我真是体会到被BEAM射到的零号机的感觉了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 157, "start": "0:10:55.01", "end": "0:10:57.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  辛苦了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 158, "start": "0:10:57.17", "end": "0:10:58.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这待遇差算啥啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:58.75", "end": "0:10:59.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "辛苦了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 160, "start": "0:10:59.59", "end": "0:11:01.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "店长大叔也谢谢大家了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 161, "start": "0:11:02.03", "end": "0:11:03.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不要大叔的感谢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 162, "start": "0:11:03.77", "end": "0:11:04.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "工钱呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 163, "start": "0:11:05.59", "end": "0:11:06.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个咯"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 164, "start": "0:11:06.57", "end": "0:11:07.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 165, "start": "0:11:08.25", "end": "0:11:11.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我很早之前就很想要这个了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 166, "start": "0:11:12.10", "end": "0:11:15.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们就为了这种东西累死累活地干活么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 167, "start": "0:11:16.13", "end": "0:11:18.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把这放在社团室做纪念吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:18.82", "end": "0:11:21.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你想什么时候穿都可以哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:21.99", "end": "0:11:23.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我许可的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:23.56", "end": "0:11:24.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:26.57", "end": "0:11:27.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么啦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:27.53", "end": "0:11:28.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  没什么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 173, "start": "0:11:29.05", "end": "0:11:29.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要看过来"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 174, "start": "0:11:29.87", "end": "0:11:31.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "试一试吧  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 175, "start": "0:11:32.02", "end": "0:11:33.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 176, "start": "0:11:34.28", "end": "0:11:35.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "冰棍要溶了哦"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 177, "start": "0:11:39.80", "end": "0:11:42.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那天晚上  夺去了我的安眠的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:42.97", "end": "0:11:44.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是一个电话"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 179, "start": "0:11:45.26", "end": "0:11:46.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你所拨的电话已…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 180, "start": "0:11:46.96", "end": "0:11:48.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呜…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 181, "start": "0:11:49.22", "end": "0:11:49.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 182, "start": "0:11:52.14", "end": "0:11:53.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 183, "start": "0:11:53.95", "end": "0:11:54.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 184, "start": "0:11:55.23", "end": "0:11:57.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是  是我"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 185, "start": "0:11:58.55", "end": "0:12:03.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有非常不好的事情…这样下去我…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:04.33", "end": "0:12:05.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:05.31", "end": "0:12:06.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好  我是古泉"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:07.48", "end": "0:12:10.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你怎么会这个时候跟朝比奈学姐在一起"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:11.22", "end": "0:12:15.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为有点情况  你能现在就过来么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 190, "start": "0:12:23.06", "end": "0:12:25.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到底发生什么事了  朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:26.10", "end": "0:12:28.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…阿虚…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 192, "start": "0:12:28.38", "end": "0:12:35.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我回不了未来了  呜…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 193, "start": "0:12:35.86", "end": "0:12:37.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  事情是这样的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 194, "start": "0:12:38.16", "end": "0:12:41.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们在永久地重复着同样的时间"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 195, "start": "0:12:42.54", "end": "0:12:45.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算你满面春光地把那种非现实的话说出来…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 196, "start": "0:12:46.56", "end": "0:12:49.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  你知道自己在说什么吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 197, "start": "0:12:49.96", "end": "0:12:53.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "知道  没有比现在更清楚的了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 198, "start": "0:12:54.04", "end": "0:12:56.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我刚才和朝比奈学姐谈了下"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 199, "start": "0:12:56.98", "end": "0:12:58.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒是叫上我啊  这么美的谈话"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 200, "start": "0:12:59.14", "end": "0:13:04.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后意识到最近这里时间的流动出现了异常"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 201, "start": "0:13:04.70", "end": "0:13:07.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这该说是朝比奈学姐的功绩吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 202, "start": "0:13:07.96", "end": "0:13:10.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "托她的福我也确信了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 203, "start": "0:13:10.57", "end": "0:13:11.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "确信什么了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 204, "start": "0:13:14.14", "end": "0:13:18.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们已经重复体验同样的时间许多次了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:19.08", "end": "0:13:20.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个刚才就听你说了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:21.02", "end": "0:13:25.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说应该是八月十七日到三十一日之间"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:26.14", "end": "0:13:29.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们正处于一个没有尽头的暑假的正当中"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 208, "start": "0:13:30.54", "end": "0:13:32.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在确实是暑假"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 209, "start": "0:13:33.52", "end": "0:13:36.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "绝对无法结束的Endless Summer"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 210, "start": "0:13:36.78", "end": "0:13:41.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在这个世界里  九月一日之后的时间全部消失了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 211, "start": "0:13:42.83", "end": "0:13:44.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要谁相信那个啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 212, "start": "0:13:44.71", "end": "0:13:47.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我希望至少你能相信"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 213, "start": "0:13:48.49", "end": "0:13:52.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…也由我来说明一下吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 214, "start": "0:13:53.25", "end": "0:13:54.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 215, "start": "0:13:54.68", "end": "0:14:00.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为禁止说明的事项  我一直在和未来联系和做禁止说明的事项"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 216, "start": "0:14:01.61", "end": "0:14:06.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一个礼拜左右没有禁止说明的事项了啊  有点奇怪啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 217, "start": "0:14:07.77", "end": "0:14:11.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我正这么想着  于是禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 218, "start": "0:14:12.83", "end": "0:14:17.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我吓了一大跳  慌张之下就做了禁止说明的事项…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 219, "start": "0:14:18.63", "end": "0:14:23.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "完全禁止说明的事项…我到底该怎么办啊…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 220, "start": "0:14:25.36", "end": "0:14:30.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我们被困在那个叫什么封闭空间里了吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 221, "start": "0:14:30.37", "end": "0:14:31.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并不是这样"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:31.92", "end": "0:14:34.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是一部分的时间被分割开了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:35.57", "end": "0:14:39.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到八月三十一日二十四时整的那一瞬"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:39.69", "end": "0:14:44.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一切都被重置  再回到十七日的过程"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 225, "start": "0:14:44.91", "end": "0:14:45.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 226, "start": "0:14:46.14", "end": "0:14:48.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  全人类的记忆呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 227, "start": "0:14:48.85", "end": "0:14:53.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那些也会重置  会重头再来一次"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 228, "start": "0:14:54.24", "end": "0:14:56.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是关于时间这个那个了的问题吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 229, "start": "0:14:57.44", "end": "0:15:00.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然未来人也混进来了那我觉得也没办法"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 230, "start": "0:15:01.48", "end": "0:15:04.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  这件事和朝比奈学姐没关系"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 231, "start": "0:15:04.72", "end": "0:15:06.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那原因是什么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 232, "start": "0:15:07.50", "end": "0:15:08.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是凉宫同学吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 233, "start": "0:15:10.02", "end": "0:15:11.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然本人没有这个自觉"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 234, "start": "0:15:11.85", "end": "0:15:15.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是心里什么地方总在想着暑假不要结束吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 235, "start": "0:15:16.02", "end": "0:15:18.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那算啥啊  难道留着什么遗憾吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 236, "start": "0:15:19.76", "end": "0:15:20.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是这么想的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 237, "start": "0:15:22.39", "end": "0:15:27.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许她是想着暑假还有什么事情剩下没做吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 238, "start": "0:15:29.86", "end": "0:15:32.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才我就觉得  你好像乐在其中呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 239, "start": "0:15:34.00", "end": "0:15:38.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为最近频繁发生的既视感之谜终于解开了嘛"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 240, "start": "0:15:39.56", "end": "0:15:46.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在想来  那只能理解为是由于记忆重置而散落下来的残渣吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 241, "start": "0:15:47.62", "end": "0:15:50.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "全世界的人都感觉得到这个吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 242, "start": "0:15:51.10", "end": "0:15:55.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并不是这样  我和你算是特例了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 243, "start": "0:15:56.79", "end": "0:16:01.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像只有和凉宫同学亲近的人才能感觉到这份异样"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 244, "start": "0:16:01.87", "end": "0:16:02.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那春日怎么样"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 245, "start": "0:16:03.52", "end": "0:16:05.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙多少有一点意识到吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 246, "start": "0:16:05.97", "end": "0:16:07.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一点都没有呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 247, "start": "0:16:08.24", "end": "0:16:10.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒不如说有了反而糟糕了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 248, "start": "0:16:11.53", "end": "0:16:13.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  别说是既视感了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 249, "start": "0:16:13.56", "end": "0:16:19.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得应该有一个人保存着所有轮回中的记忆"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 250, "start": "0:16:24.00", "end": "0:16:24.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…是这样的吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 251, "start": "0:16:25.31", "end": "0:16:25.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 252, "start": "0:16:26.71", "end": "0:16:28.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你全都记得吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 253, "start": "0:16:28.87", "end": "0:16:29.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 254, "start": "0:16:30.26", "end": "0:16:33.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺带问下  这重复…现在到底几次了？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 255, "start": "0:16:35.26", "end": "0:16:38.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次是第15521次"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 256, "start": "0:16:40.11", "end": "0:16:42.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15521？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 257, "start": "0:16:45.22", "end": "0:16:48.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15521是啥啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 258, "start": "0:16:51.49", "end": "0:16:53.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你那话是认真的吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 259, "start": "0:16:54.09", "end": "0:16:54.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 260, "start": "0:16:55.22", "end": "0:16:59.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么多的次数  我们全都在重复同样的事情吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 261, "start": "0:17:00.19", "end": "0:17:01.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并非全部如此"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 262, "start": "0:17:02.52", "end": "0:17:12.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15521次中没有去盂兰盆会的模式  有第2391次和第11054次的这两次"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 263, "start": "0:17:12.87", "end": "0:17:18.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外  去了盂兰盆会而没有捞金鱼的模式有437次"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 264, "start": "0:17:19.72", "end": "0:17:25.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去打工的有9048次  其内容有6个模式"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 265, "start": "0:17:25.68", "end": "0:17:30.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了发放气球  还有搬货物  收银  发送传单  接电话…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 266, "start": "0:17:30.17", "end": "0:17:31.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…不  已经够了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 267, "start": "0:17:36.87", "end": "0:17:39.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第15521次…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 268, "start": "0:17:40.79", "end": "0:17:41.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门她这么说了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 269, "start": "0:17:43.02", "end": "0:17:46.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "乘上两周的话就是…唔…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 270, "start": "0:17:48.58", "end": "0:17:50.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "差不多是595年的时间了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 271, "start": "0:17:51.95", "end": "0:17:53.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么长的时间仅她一个人"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 272, "start": "0:17:54.21", "end": "0:17:58.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能够好好地保留着记忆  无数次无数次地重复吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 273, "start": "0:17:59.80", "end": "0:18:04.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你到底到现在为止都是什么样的心情"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 274, "start": "0:18:08.98", "end": "0:18:11.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我又听了荒唐的话了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 275, "start": "0:18:13.38", "end": "0:18:14.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不是没有啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 276, "start": "0:18:14.74", "end": "0:18:15.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么啊？"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 277, "start": "0:18:16.06", "end": "0:18:16.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "火星人"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 278, "start": "0:18:17.09", "end": "0:18:18.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我倒不希望它存在啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 279, "start": "0:18:18.97", "end": "0:18:24.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地表看起来没人  应该是在地下生活深谋远虑的人种吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 280, "start": "0:18:25.20", "end": "0:18:30.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "人类第一次踏上火星的时候一定会从暗处跑出来欢迎吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 281, "start": "0:18:31.31", "end": "0:18:32.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「欢迎来到火星」什么的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 282, "start": "0:18:33.49", "end": "0:18:35.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给我正常点登场吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 283, "start": "0:18:35.60", "end": "0:18:37.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我看够了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 284, "start": "0:18:37.91", "end": "0:18:39.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来找UFO吧  UFO"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 285, "start": "0:18:40.75", "end": "0:18:42.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天是观测天体"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 286, "start": "0:18:43.43", "end": "0:18:45.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地点是长门公寓的楼顶"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 287, "start": "0:18:45.43", "end": "0:18:48.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "天体望远镜由古泉准备"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 288, "start": "0:18:50.30", "end": "0:18:52.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙到底想做啥啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 289, "start": "0:18:52.81", "end": "0:18:54.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  是什么呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 290, "start": "0:18:54.94", "end": "0:18:57.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个能搞清楚的话问题也就迎刃而解了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 291, "start": "0:18:58.29", "end": "0:18:59.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "试下这样怎么样"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 292, "start": "0:19:00.70", "end": "0:19:02.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从后面突然抱住凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 293, "start": "0:19:02.80", "end": "0:19:06.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在她耳边轻语「I love you」"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 294, "start": "0:19:06.50", "end": "0:19:08.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这由谁来做啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 295, "start": "0:19:08.81", "end": "0:19:11.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了你没有适合的人了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 296, "start": "0:19:11.64", "end": "0:19:13.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？但是我拒绝"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 297, "start": "0:19:14.65", "end": "0:19:16.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我来做怎么样"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 298, "start": "0:19:19.38", "end": "0:19:22.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开玩笑的了  我做这角色还不够格"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 299, "start": "0:19:23.78", "end": "0:19:26.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样只会让凉宫同学增加无谓的混乱吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 300, "start": "0:19:35.22", "end": "0:19:36.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  长门"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 301, "start": "0:19:37.36", "end": "0:19:41.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在朝比奈学姐说出来之前就注意到了这轮回吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 302, "start": "0:19:42.06", "end": "0:19:42.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 303, "start": "0:19:43.30", "end": "0:19:44.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那为什么沉默不语"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 304, "start": "0:19:45.45", "end": "0:19:49.62", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（SOS团试胆大会  在这里放上证明到达了的人偶）"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 305, "start": "0:19:46.55", "end": "0:19:48.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我的任务是观察"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 306, "start": "0:19:52.57", "end": "0:19:53.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样啊…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 307, "start": "0:19:54.53", "end": "0:19:58.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怒涛般的暑假活动消化体制还在继续"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 308, "start": "0:19:58.70", "end": "0:20:00.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也去了真正的烟花汇演"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 309, "start": "0:20:00.97", "end": "0:20:02.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还去了钓虾虎鱼大会"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 310, "start": "0:20:04.67", "end": "0:20:10.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "此外还去了打击中心  电影连看  海水浴  保龄球  卡拉OK"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 311, "start": "0:20:10.33", "end": "0:20:12.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们一直在活动来活动去的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 312, "start": "0:20:13.24", "end": "0:20:17.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然我觉得春日应该不会这样就满足"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 313, "start": "0:20:17.58", "end": "0:20:20.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但即便如此也没有什么行动"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 314, "start": "0:20:21.16", "end": "0:20:26.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就这样  只有暑假剩余的日子是确实在一天天减少"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 315, "start": "0:20:28.51", "end": "0:20:32.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后终于来到了  八月三十日"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 316, "start": "0:20:39.42", "end": "0:20:41.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样课题就如实地完成了呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 317, "start": "0:20:43.67", "end": "0:20:45.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要乱涂鸦了啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 318, "start": "0:20:48.71", "end": "0:20:50.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样子好吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 319, "start": "0:20:52.54", "end": "0:20:53.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 320, "start": "0:20:53.54", "end": "0:20:55.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  也就这样了呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 321, "start": "0:20:55.46", "end": "0:20:57.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  各位  还有什么想做的吗"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 322, "start": "0:21:05.73", "end": "0:21:06.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  够了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 323, "start": "0:21:06.93", "end": "0:21:10.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个暑假已经做了好多事了  已经很充实了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 324, "start": "0:21:11.02", "end": "0:21:12.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不好！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 325, "start": "0:21:12.63", "end": "0:21:14.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你应该还没有满足才对"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 326, "start": "0:21:16.64", "end": "0:21:18.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 327, "start": "0:21:18.87", "end": "0:21:22.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天当预备日先空下来了  大家就这样休息吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 328, "start": "0:21:23.28", "end": "0:21:25.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "后天在社团教室再见吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 329, "start": "0:21:34.28", "end": "0:21:35.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等等啊  春日！"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 330, "start": "0:21:38.34", "end": "0:21:40.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 331, "start": "0:21:40.50", "end": "0:21:44.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天当预备日先空下来了  大家就这样休息吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 332, "start": "0:21:44.93", "end": "0:21:47.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "后天在社团教室再见吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 333, "start": "0:21:50.27", "end": "0:21:52.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不能在这里放春日回去"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 334, "start": "0:21:54.59", "end": "0:21:55.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让你回去的话"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 335, "start": "0:21:55.83", "end": "0:22:00.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那重复了一万几千次的两星期又要陷入永远循环的窘境了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 336, "start": "0:22:01.26", "end": "0:22:03.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 337, "start": "0:22:03.34", "end": "0:22:07.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天当预备日先空下来了  大家就这样休息吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 338, "start": "0:22:07.88", "end": "0:22:09.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "后天在社团教室再见吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 339, "start": "0:22:10.21", "end": "0:22:12.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我该做什么呢  应该说什么呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 340, "start": "0:22:15.71", "end": "0:22:18.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在春日的话里应该有提示的"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 341, "start": "0:22:19.10", "end": "0:22:20.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但那是什么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 342, "start": "0:22:21.23", "end": "0:22:23.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她至今都说了些什么"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 343, "start": "0:22:24.59", "end": "0:22:27.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不明白  也想不到…"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 344, "start": "0:22:28.36", "end": "0:22:30.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 345, "start": "0:22:30.58", "end": "0:22:34.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天当预备日先空下来了  大家就这样休息吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 346, "start": "0:22:34.95", "end": "0:22:37.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "后天在社团教室再见吧"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 347, "start": "0:22:42.39", "end": "0:22:43.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么都成了"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 348, "start": "0:22:46.76", "end": "0:22:48.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "八月三十一日"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 349, "start": "0:22:48.88", "end": "0:22:50.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "作业  还没动过"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 350, "start": "0:22:50.71", "end": "0:22:51.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "管他呢"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 351, "start": "0:22:53.26", "end": "0:22:57.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果再重复的话  作业做了也没意义啊"}
{"ep": "16", "idx": 352, "start": "0:23:00.77", "end": "0:23:06.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管明天来不来  到时候就交给那时的我算啦"}
